;   24: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=255, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ひんし, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   25: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ぬ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   26: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=11195903, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   27: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=255, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=かな, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   28: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ゆが, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   29: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=255, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=だま, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=10721, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=9813, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\Brutal.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\桜のじゅうたん.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\糸姫赤\糸姫赤.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Just as I thought, <STYLE ID="1">this girl</STYLE> is different.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This girl</STYLE> is no ordinary human...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For all her apologies and her show of concessions, it seems she has no intention of being choosy about how she reaches her goal.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't know why she's going to Motoki-cho, but what my intuition showed me at Toyotake Station during the day has finally connected here.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "200" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"You've got to be kidding! Why should Motoki-cho turn into a ghost town because of </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> selfishness!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"A ghost town... you mean a </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="はいきょ">ruin</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　It will not become a </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="はいきょ">ruin</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">In Motoki-cho a wonderfully large cherry tree will grow, insects around it, and small animals and birds will come seeking the insects. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Motoki-cho will change its shape and flourish."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's not what I'm talking about! You're going to kill people, aren't you!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No―every mammal, humans included."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's even worse! Stop it! Stop it right now!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Many sacrifices pain me, but I have waited more than 800 years for this. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">In truth, until more people gathered in Motoki-cho―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">yes, I thought to wait another 15 years or so... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But now that you know, I must hurry. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Motoki-cho will soon sink to the bottom of a sea of cherry blossoms, like this mountain."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, nothing you say to </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">this thing</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is going to work!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\美冬怒り血.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"I knew it. </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">This little brat</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> has to be killed right here...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I don't feel like stopping </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> anymore either..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Beings that bring nothing but harm―that such ones exist is the way of this world.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if you <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="うた">proclaim</STYLE> yourself to be in the right, to those who stand against you, you are nothing but evil.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's why conflicts like this happen.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Itohime-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, was it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　I don't think </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'re that bad a person, but if you don't mean to stop, I'll douse you in my blood, okay?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　I know my own lethal amount well enough."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Kana-chan</STYLE> stepped forward, dragging her leg, and put the knife to her arm.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"The first and second generations, infected with Droga, go strange from the mummy's spores, yet the third generation doesn't. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">So the third generation must have some kind of antibodies. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">When that gets on </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, the antibodies start destroying </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">'s cells. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Something like that, I suppose."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Goto</STYLE>, too, seemed to have no intention of opposing this declaration of war on <STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"It is true, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> blood makes Shigatsu Youka suffer. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But even if </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> blood were wrung out to the last drop, there would not be enough to destroy us. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Had </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Chigaya-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> at least remained third generation and given every drop of her blood, and had all of </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kana-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> blood been added to it, it might have been possible... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That is also why </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> used falsificaso on </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Chigaya-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"B-but! Even so, if I can beat </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Itohime-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"As I said, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> blood alone is not enough.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　You may try it, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> will only die for nothing. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Besides, I am a living human being, and right now I am apart from Shigatsu Youka, so even if I touch </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> blood, it will have no effect at all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Ngh...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Now, shall we begin? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I do not wish to add more victims than I must. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Natsumi Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and one more―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">if someone will become a living one of the first generation, I promise to return the others alive."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物3" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Wait! What happens to </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and the other one!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"As you see, they become great trees like </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and as divine messengers they are granted rest for all </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="えいごう">eternity</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Don't be ridiculous! That's as good as dying, isn't it!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　I'll never let </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> die!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Is it painful to be parted from </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Obviously!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then would </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> not become the living one of the first generation?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then you would be with </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> forever and ever."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"I knew it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...! You're insane...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I think it is not a bad offer.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　If </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> becomes the living one of the first generation, the others can go home unharmed. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Besides, merely becoming first generation is not enough. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">When the living are made divine messengers, they must choose to become one themselves. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Now that the Verde mummy cannot be used, I need you to wish to become one."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Like I'd ever want to be one of </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> guys!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Please, think it over once more. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">As things stand, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> will surely kill everyone here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But if </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> become first generation and choose to become a divine messenger, everyone else―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">the residents of the settlement too, every one of them will be safe."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"No...! But―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Holding everyone hostage, making me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> divine messengers, making us </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s allies... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">And that would save everyone...?" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島怒りバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"What are you wavering for!? That's absolutely not okay!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I-I know already!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"And anyway, I'm not wavering!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\美冬血.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物3" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Negotiations have broken down. However far we take this, we'll never meet. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, young lady, I don't know what </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'re up to, but I'd be happy if you'd just die right here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフを構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱ナイフ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Mm... If </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> claim to be one of the living, what would happen if I slit </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="けいどうみゃく">carotid artery</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> with this?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Why not try? I would merely die."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Mm... 'Merely die'... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Do you understand what you're saying!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Cut my throat and I merely die. That alone changes nothing. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka's power will at once revive me as one of the dead, and Motoki-cho, with cherry trees―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物3" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Forget it! So nothing we do makes any difference, huh!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Anyway, I don't care about </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> goal, but why are you so hung up on Motoki-cho!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"............?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
