<STYLE ID="1">"The first time this place and Motoki-cho were connected was about 60 years ago. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It sprouted one offshoot, then ran its hyphae all through the ground, remaking the soil into a kind suited to Shigatsu Youka―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">at last, everything is in place for the whole of Shigatsu Youka to grow on its own in Motoki-cho. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">All that remains is to move over there through the ground and fulfill the wish together with the four divine messengers."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"As </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> said earlier, Shigatsu Youka has a fatal weakness: the blood of the third generation. </STYLE>
