<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Shut up!"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Like I care!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Obasan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> stamped on <STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE>'s hands at the same moment.
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE追加\bakibaki低.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Gh...! It hurts...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"It hurts? You've killed so many people, and now you have the nerve to say that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> deserve a lot worse than this."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> ground her heel even harder into <STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE>'s hand.<PG>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Even if you die, you come back through </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s power, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Then how about I chop you into so many pieces you can't come back?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Mm... You made me try to kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, and then pinned the crime on me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Um, to cut off her arms and legs without her dying, what I'd need to do is..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Don't kill her right off."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No...! Stop it...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Hey, everyone, hold on..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I understand why everyone wants to take their anger out on her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, how do I put it―
{PAUSE ""}
it's pitiful.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No word but 'pitiful' comes to mind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Cut off from <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>, she is a powerless girl.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And this many of us, giving way to anger, have her surrounded.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\桜のじゅうたん.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Come on, get up! You can't do a thing on your own, and you still came strolling out here!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\美冬怒り血.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"I'll teach you just how terrifying that is. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">First, I'll hurt you just short of killing you... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">And at the end, let's see, how about I </STYLE><STYLE ID="19" RUBY="は">strip</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> the skin off your whole body?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Mm... I don't often get angry at people. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">But when the culprit who killed </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> is right in front of me, that's another story."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"First time I've ever hunted a human."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Uh... isn't this going a little too far..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Shut up! Don't you get that our family was killed!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Mm... And not just that, she </STYLE><STYLE ID="20" RUBY="あお">stirred up</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> distrust among everyone in the settlement and made them suffer. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="21">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> was left agonizing, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="22">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> got treated like the culprit."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Seppuku wouldn't even begin to cover this, right? I may not look it, but this is the maddest I've ever been in my life, you know?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\糸姫赤\糸姫赤2.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2,000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The one controlling <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>, a thing you could call a man-made disaster or a natural one, is this frail, powerless girl.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the first place, could <STYLE ID="1">a girl like this</STYLE> really have been controlling <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Seeing her powerless, <STYLE ID="23" RUBY="きゃしゃ">delicate</STYLE> figure, even that starts to seem doubtful.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\桜のじゅうたん.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Please, let me talk to </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">that girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"What!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I walked up to <STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hold on, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! What good is talking going to do!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I still have things I want to hear from </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">this girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Are you kidding me!? </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">This thing</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is still a mass murderer, isn't it!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Mm... What's more, she wrecked the settlement's unity."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Please wait. That would be like a witch hunt, no different from the barbaric punishments of the past. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">In this day and age, even a violent criminal gets a lawyer, and it's standard practice to hear out everything about why they committed the crime. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Or are </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> and the others anachronistic barbarians?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"What </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> and the others are doing right now is just as selfish and barbaric as </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">that girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Tch! Fine! Do what you want!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\美冬血.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Well... it's not as if we're in a hurry."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
The four who had surrounded her opened a path to <STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then I met the gaze of <STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE>, her hands still on the ground.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\糸姫赤\糸姫赤2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Hey, tell me. I want to hear </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> story properly."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, don't get close! She'll stab you with the Droga!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I'm second generation, so it wouldn't do anything."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But still..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... did you really do all of this?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Hey, tell me. Did </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> do it?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes. I did it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE> spoke with her face still lowered.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"800 years ago, I came face to face with death in an accident. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But Shigatsu Youka saved me when I was </STYLE><STYLE ID="24" RUBY="ひんし">on the brink of death</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">In return, I gave Shigatsu Youka human intelligence."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\桜乱立.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ordinarily, Shigatsu Youka and I are one. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">In that form, capturing </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> all would be a simple thing. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But right now, Shigatsu Youka is greatly exhausted from connecting with Motoki-cho. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">While Shigatsu Youka rests, I must do things myself."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, that is not true... I have relied on Shigatsu Youka too much. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So at least at the end, I want to see it through with my own hands. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">To make my wish come true, at least at the end..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"What is </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> wish?</STYLE> <STYLE ID="4">What do you want to do in Motoki-cho?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I wish to be at the side of someone dear to me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Is that person in Motoki-cho?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"The one I speak of died about 800 years ago, in the land of Motoki. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> all call the place the goshinboku. Beneath it, the one I speak of lies sleeping."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"So </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> just want to see that person in Motoki-cho?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Well?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"My wish truly is only that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka, on the other hand, desires to flourish as a living thing. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Our interests matched, and so I..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"You don't actually want to kill everyone, right?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"That is right... For what it is worth, I tried to keep the victims as few as I could. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I chose only the old, who had little time left, as victims, and when even that had no effect, I kept it to one person a year... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It does not change the fact that I took many people's lives... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But in order to meet that person, I had no choice but to make them sacrifices..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Wasn't there a way to do it without killing?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That was impossible. At first, I did not want to kill either. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But as you know, Shigatsu Youka needs corpses to grow. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If I kept refusing to increase the corpses, Shigatsu Youka would abandon me."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"So 'abandon' means that unless you killed someone, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you would have died?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Ordinarily Shigatsu Youka and I are one, so if it abandoned me, I would die at once. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Nor would it ever revive me, when I am refusing it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But... I am not afraid of dying, not anymore."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"I see... So you really hated killing."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But the fact is, I killed. It cannot be forgiven, and I am only lining up ugly excuses. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So, as </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> said, it does not change the fact that I am a selfish mass murderer."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, there's just one way to settle this."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Right now you're cut off from </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Now, while you can... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">now, while you can, why don't you just come to Motoki-cho with us?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\桜のじゅうたん.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\糸姫赤\糸姫赤.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"What?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hearing that, <STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE> lifted her head at once.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"If you just want to see that person, there's no need to destroy Motoki-cho. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Won't you come with us?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"B-but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Deep in her eyes, <STYLE ID="25" RUBY="ぬ">wet</STYLE> with tears―something seemed to shine.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! What the hell are you saying!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">but </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">this girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> only wants to be near someone dear to her!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　She hated it, but she had to kill people! If she defied it, she'd die!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you're way too soft!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Mm... I can't accept </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">this girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> either. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Because </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Yeah... She's the one who killed </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, isn't she?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"I... understand a little how </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> feels."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You guys can only say that because you haven't had your families taken!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　If </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> family had been killed, you couldn't say the same thing!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"You're right... I'm sure of it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">That's exactly why I can simply feel sorry for </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">this girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">If there's any way at all, even a small one, to settle this peacefully..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Don't you start too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> of all people can't forgive </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">this thing</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, right!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Because of </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">this thing</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">―think how much </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> suffered!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬うつむき逆.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">I once said the same thing to </STYLE><STYLE ID="26">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> in Megasawa, didn't I."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"That if the children bullying </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> weren't killed, the Kogori family wouldn't get off lightly. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">If </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> hadn't come that time, I might have done the same as </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">this girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Granted, for killing </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">this girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> is someone I can't forgive. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">do I have any right to blame </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">this girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">What I tried to do in Megasawa is no different from what </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">this girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> did."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But even so, that doesn't mean..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\糸姫赤\糸姫赤.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I... still cannot do that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Even if there are those who would understand, such a thing..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"R-right...! No matter how painful her circumstances were... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">that doesn't mean... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">that's just... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Damn it, what is this? Not just </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, but even </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, what about you!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, what about you!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　You can't forgive </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">this thing</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, right!?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Mm... I can't forgive her, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">still, what could </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">this girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> have done to be saved?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　I'm sorry, I don't know..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Yeah... So it was kill or be killed, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　The animals I've tried to hunt have tried to kill me lots of times, so they wouldn't get killed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　You can't exactly call that selfish, can you?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"But </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">this thing</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> says it's not afraid of dying!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"So that makes it okay to kill her? Isn't that weird?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Not being scared to die and it being okay to die aren't the same thing, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What's with you guys...! Am I wrong...?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\糸姫赤\糸姫赤.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I am the one who committed the greatest wrong. I understand that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So I have no right to go to Motoki-cho with all of you..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"First, tell me what </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> want. What everyone else thinks can come after that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, what will you do? Even without relying on </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, I think there's a way to make your wish come true. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Why haven't you ever tried to go to Motoki-cho on </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">your own</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> two feet?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"As I said before, ordinarily Shigatsu Youka and I are one. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">As long as Shigatsu Youka is here, I cannot move from here either. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That is why, in exchange for my giving it intelligence, Shigatsu Youka accepted my wish and decided to move to Motoki-cho."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"But right now, Shigatsu Youka is greatly exhausted. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So that it can rest, I have been cut off for a little while, for the first time in several hundred years. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Keeping a living human from aging seems to be hard work, even for Shigatsu Youka."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Then right now you could come to Motoki-cho with us, couldn't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">true, but..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Seriously, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'re so soft... I'm all out of steam..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\美冬血.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"But you know </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> always manages to make the choice that lets everyone be happy, don't you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　I was saved by </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> once too, long ago."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"I gave in to my anger a moment ago too, but whatever we do to </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">this girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> here and now, nothing will change. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> would stay just as it is."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, what will you do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I held out my hand to <STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\糸姫赤\糸姫赤.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Is it... truly all right...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, is that okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">"Just do whatever you want already... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">After getting called barbarians and whatnot, and then hearing a story like this, I don't feel like doing anything..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Thanks, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Come on, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, stand up."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE> took my hand and slowly stood up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Let's go. To Motoki-cho."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Leading <STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE> by the hand, I started walking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then <STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE> looked over at <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="5">Obasan</STYLE>, and the others.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\糸姫赤\糸姫赤2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Um..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What? You planning to say 'I'm sorry' now, of all times?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"There is that as well, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I truly am shameless, I suppose..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Bit late for that... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But if we don't do this, Motoki-cho's in trouble, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You're right... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It was my will that made Shigatsu Youka choose Motoki-cho, so without that..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"So </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> dear one is already dead, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Visiting the grave would be enough for you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"When I was taken into Shigatsu Youka, the one I speak of was still alive. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But a few years later, that person passed away in the land of Motoki... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Decades ago, when this place and Motoki-cho were connected, I was able to touch the remains of the one I speak of for the first time, but..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\糸姫赤\糸姫赤.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"In that state, it turned out that not even Shigatsu Youka's power could revive what remained."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So, as </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> says, sadly, all I can do is hold a memorial before the remains. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But I have come this far. If I could at least make just that much </STYLE><STYLE ID="27" RUBY="かな">come true</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
While listening to <STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE>'s story, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> had been frowning; now her face <STYLE ID="28" RUBY="ゆが">twisted</STYLE> even more.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Up to now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> has moved lots of corpses and grown cherry trees out of corpses, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes, that is true..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That once a body's a skeleton it can't be brought back―surely </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> knew that a long time ago, didn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What do you mean?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"I see what </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> is getting at. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">In other words, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> never intended to bring that person back to life, from the very start."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">doesn't that mean you've been used by </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> all along?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"As long as it got human intelligence, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">'s wish didn't matter at all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Once it can move somewhere with more people than here and breed more, it has no further use for </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">―that's what this means."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That cannot be..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"It gradually gained human intelligence, and the reason it still wouldn't let </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> go even after that person died... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> wanted to keep its existence from leaking to the outside through </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">was deceived by Shigatsu Youka...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　All I did was keep killing people...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! Let's get out of here, quick! Next time </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> starts moving, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> won't come out of it safe either!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\糸姫赤\糸姫赤2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"N-no...! To think I... had been </STYLE><STYLE ID="29" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　All I wanted was to be at that person's side...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　And all I was doing was killing, again and again...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! Hurry!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Thank you very much. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">it seems this is as far as I go."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"As far as you go...?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
